{"id":"cofqolqwiq6s5y7ghjho3ynim","title":"古代文献常用（今人费解）词语（153）：绿天","originalTitle":null,"summary":"\"绿天\"是古代文献中芭蕉的雅称，源自唐代书法家怀素以蕉叶代纸练字的典故。芭蕉叶片宽大，浓绿成荫，故有此名。文中提及宋·佚名《宣和书谱·卷十九·唐释怀素》中记载了怀素以芭蕉叶练字并命名其居所为\"绿天庵\"的典故。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1251036&do=blog&id=1560069"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T01:18:44.590Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T01:18:44.590Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":12,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}